E AX3020 585-multi-rule-misuse.ax:24:8-17 macro-duplicate-parameter "macro `sameArity` declares two rules taking 1 arguments" !"a rule-form macro selects its rule by ARITY (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-14), so the second rule of a repeated arity can never be reached" ?"give the rules different parameter counts, or merge them"
E AX3018 585-multi-rule-misuse.ax:40:2-8 macro-arity "macro `spread` takes 1 or 3 arguments, but was given 2" !"a rule-form macro selects its rule by ARITY (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-14): the rules are tried in order and the first whose parameter count matches wins, so an invocation matching none is this refusal rather than a fall-through" ?"pass as many arguments as one of the macro's rules declares parameters"
